flowchart TD
    title Product Browsing Flow

    A[Open Catalog] --> B{Has Search Query?}
    B -->|No| C[Show Featured Products]
    B -->|Yes| D[Parse Search Query]
    D --> E[Apply Category Filter]
    E --> F[Apply Price Range]
    F --> G[Apply Rating Filter]
    G --> H[Sort Results]
    H --> I[Paginate]
    I --> J[Enrich with Ratings]
    J --> K[Return Product List]
    C --> K

    K --> L{User Clicks Product?}
    L -->|No| M[End]
    L -->|Yes| N[Load Product Detail]
    N --> O[Load Reviews]
    O --> P[Load Related Products]
    P --> Q[Show Product Page]
